ion : Session Type : HTTP Cookie embed.app.guidde.com 1 firebase-heartbeat-database#firebase-heartbeat-store Used in order to detect spam and improve the website's security. Maximum Storage Duration : Persistent Type : IndexedDB eum.instana.io 1 in-session This cookie is used to detect errors on the website - this information is sent to the website's support staff in order to optimize the visitor's experience on the website. Maximum Storage Duration : Persistent Type : HTML Local Storage idp.aalto.fi 1 __Host-JSESSIONID Pending Maximum Storage Duration : Session Type : HTTP Cookie static-assets-cdn.i.cloud.panopto.eu 1 testcookie This cookie determines whether the browser accepts cookies. Maximum Storage Duration : Session Type : HTTP Cookie Functional 7 Functional cookies enable a website to remember information that changes the way the website behaves or looks, like your preferred language or the region that you are in. These cookies can also be used to enhance the contents of the webpage (e.g., by embedding maps or rich media). LinkedIn 1 Learn more about this provider lidc Registers which server-cluster is serving the visitor. This is used in context with load balancing, in order to optimize user experience. Maximum Storage Duration : 1 day Type : HTTP Cookie Sketchfab 1 Learn more about this provider userEvents Pending Maximum Storage Duration : Persistent Type : HTML Local Storage aalto.cloud.panopto.eu 1 UserSettings This cookie is used to determine the preferred quality of video content, this is based on visitor settings. Maximum Storage Duration : 400 days Type : HTTP Cookie embed.app.guidde.com 1 firebaseLocalStorageDb#firebaseLocalStorage Facilitates the notification function within the chatbox, allowing the website’s support team to notify the user, when a reply has been given in the chatbox. Maximum Storage Duration : Persistent Type : IndexedDB ninchat.com 3 ninchat_aalto_matkustuspalvelut_window Pending Maximum Storage Duration : Session Type : HTML Local Storage ninchat_aalto_opiskelijapsykologi_päivystys_window Pending Maximum Storage Duration : Session Type : HTML Local Storage ninchat_AaltoIT_window Pending Maximum Storage Duration : Session Type : HTML Local Storage Statistics 41 Statistic cookies help us to understand how visitors interact with the website by collecting and reporting information anonymously. We use this data to help us make improvements to site performance, usability and content. Adobe Inc. 1 Learn more about this provider p.gif Keeps track of special fonts used on the website for internal analysis. The cookie does not register any visitor data. Maximum Storage Duration : Session Type : Pixel Tracker Google 2 Learn more about this provider Some of the data collected by this provider is for the purposes of personalization and measuring advertising effectiveness. The provider may use the IP Addresses for ads measurement and ads personalization. _ga Used to send data to Google Analytics about the visitor's device and behavior. Tracks the visitor across devices and marketing channels. Maximum Storage Duration : 2 years Type : HTTP Cookie _ga_# Used to send data to Google Analytics about the visitor's device and behavior. Tracks the visitor across devices and marketing channels. Maximum Storage Duration : 2 years Type : HTTP Cookie Hotjar 8 Learn more about this provider _hjSession_# [x2] Collects statistics on the visitor's visits to the website, such as the number of visits, average time spent on the website and what pages have been read. Maximum Storage Duration : 1 day Type : HTTP Cookie _hjSessionUser_# [x2] Collects statistics on the visitor's visits to the website, such as the number of visits, average time spent on the website and what pages have been read. Maximum Storage Duration : 1 year Type : HTTP Cookie _hjTLDTest Registers statistical data on users' behaviour on the website. Used for internal analytics by the website operator. Maximum Storage Duration : Session Type : HTTP Cookie